  "body": "Similar to #201.  Both \"reload\" and \"no-store\" want to avoid looking the response up in the cache, so in both cases the UA needs to set the no-cache headers to signal this to the HTTP proxies.\n\nI forgot to mention this in #201, sorry about that!\n",
